description.narrative:
The overall goal of the project is "To enhance the role of women and youth to contribute to achieving sustainable peace and security in Africa". 

Specific objectives are to:

1. Enhance knowledge of grassroots women actors in gender, peace and security to contribute to the implementation of the WPS and YPS agenda in Africa;

2. Strengthen the capacity of youth in leadership and peacebuilding to contribute to sustainable peace and security in Africa;

3. Enhance the knowledge and skills among local actors to promote national mechanisms to prevent gender-based violence (GBV) and violent extremism (VE) in Africa;

4. Improve monitoring and reporting mechanisms to promote the implementation of the WPS agenda in Africa;

5. Enhance women and youth participation in election processes;

6. Generate knowledge on the effects of climate change on the implementation of the WPS and YPS agenda to influence policy decisions;

7. Enhance the capacity of staff of the WYPSI to support project implementation.
